WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.019
One farm policy can't fit

2
00:00:02.019 --> 00:00:03.967
both Kerala and Ladakh.

3
00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:07.323
So planners drew agro-climatic zones.

4
00:00:07.661 --> 00:00:10.654
The Planning Commission divided India

5
00:00:10.654 --> 00:00:13.056
into 15 agro-climatic zones in

6
00:00:13.056 --> 00:00:14.800
the late 1980s,

7
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.814
based on soil,

8
00:00:15.814 --> 00:00:17.625
climate, and water.

9
00:00:17.954 --> 00:00:19.792
The Western Himalayan region,

10
00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:21.724
the Trans-Gangetic plains,

11
00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:23.482
and the Western dry region,

12
00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:24.818
among others.

13
00:00:25.151 --> 00:00:27.516
The topic also covers irrigation,

14
00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:29.474
seeds and fertilisers,

15
00:00:29.474 --> 00:00:32.392
land reforms and food security.

16
00:00:32.746 --> 00:00:33.923
Your turn.

17
00:00:33.923 --> 00:00:35.761
How many zones?
